Z||000006||286SE'S||10-11-2000||03:17 PM||||Contact Mr. Mikes. He has a video that he will sell you showing how to recover your seats. You may also find one in The Mall.<BR>The little 3 1/2" speakers are available from almost any source. You will probably have to solder the wires if you don't buy some GM adapters. Since they will never be apart again, not worth the extra $.<BR>||||reg||7
