Z||000011||Philphine||10-12-2000||11:26 AM||||thanks for te addy. looks doable. the best 3.5's i know of are pioneer tsm-871 (hope i got that model # right). strictly midrange speakers, no tweeters or wizzer cones, you shouldn't want highs behind you any way. also the only 3.5 i know of that comes with grills. the grills are good for amp fan covers or if you want to try a small center channel speaker you won't have to try to make a 3.5" grill. i think they're still made. just a little side info there.  ||||reg||1
